      <path transform="translate(150 0)" fill="#f2b33d" d="M455 360c48-64 128-112 156-172 24-52-18-92 8-122 10-12 28-16 36-18 4 4-4 10-6 18-12 36 44 72 42 124-2 72-66 108-44 170z"/>
